  <title>Time clock tool</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Administration</gui><gui>Time clock tool</gui></guiseq>
  corrects punches in the <link xref="time_clock"/>.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Employee</gui> and the <gui>Project</gui>, or
    check <gui>View all</gui> beside either. Each employee and project is
    listed with the total time.</p></item>
    <item><p>Double click one to list its punches, with the
    <gui>Actual</gui> time and the <gui>Adjusted</gui> time.</p></item>
    <item><p>Double click a punch, then click <gui>Edit or add
    entry</gui>.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>In the <gui>Edit entry</gui> window, click the day, hour or minute of the
  <gui>In Time</gui> or <gui>Out Time</gui>, and move it with its
  <gui>Offset</gui>. Then click <gui>Save edits to entry</gui>, <gui>Add new
  entry</gui> to keep the original and add a new punch with these times, or
  <gui>Delete entry</gui>.</p>

  <note style="warning"><p>Only correct punches that are clearly a mistake,
  such as a forgotten punch out. Time records may be needed as legal records
  of hours worked.</p></note>

</page>
